Compling the Code:
==================

In order to compile the code simply type "make" at the command prompt.

Running the Code:
=================

Before running the code you need to set the two parameters which
are found at the end of the initialization file "pluto.ini".
See description in the header of init.cpp.

Once you've set them, type "./pluto" at the command prompt.

Visualizing the data:
=====================

Data can be visualized using Gnuplot, IDL or Python.
With Gnuplot,a  script "khi.gp" can be used to produce an animation 
throughout the simulation data.
The variable to be visualized together with its name can be set under the
section "Plot Specifications".
Variable names (rho, prs, vx1, ...) are listed inside "pluto.gp".



